            <title>[IGNITE-13507] NullPointerException on tx recovery</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13507</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Server node failed because of NullPointerException on tx recovery:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
